    "id": "1687037004687765504",
    "text": "YouTube is Getting AI-Powered Dubbing!\n\nYes, you heard me right. No more Language barrier.\n\nNow, you can create one single video targeting the entire world!\n\nHere’s everything you need to know: ⤵️\n\n- YouTube is launching a new AI tool called Aloud to help creators dub their videos into other languages.\n\n- Aloud first transcribes the video, lets the creator edit the transcript, then translates and produces the dub.\n\n- YouTube is currently testing Aloud with hundreds of creators.\n\n- Currently, Aloud supports dubbing videos into English, Spanish, and Portuguese.\n\n- The AI tool could help more creators add multi-language dubs to their videos.\n\n- In the future, YouTube plans to make the AI dubs sound more like the creator's voice and have better lip-syncing.\n\n- Those features are planned for 2024.\n\nWhat's your take on this? Are you excited to experience this?",
